 * pages, plus what only a signed-in customer gets: what's already on their
 * servers, and one-tap install onto a server that can take each mod.
 *
 * Default view = discovery (featured, games, categories, ranked rails) with the
 * full catalogue browser underneath. Any filter in the URL (search, game,
 * category, loader, sort, page) leads with results instead — a filtered link
 * lands on what it asked for. Every result set is filtered and paginated on
 * the server (24 per page over ~64k rows), and every control is a URL.
